SUMMARY:Shoe Swap 2026
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars! Join us on Sat Sept 12 10am-3pm  for our Fall Shoe Swap of the season at Boulderz Etobicoke. \nBring your old climbing shoes—no holes\, please—and swap them for another pair. We have sizes available for both kids and adults! \n  \n 
