SUMMARY:Boulderz Community initiative The Drop Zone | Easter Seals
DESCRIPTION:We’re excited to announce Boulderz Community initiative—an opportunity for everyone to come together and make a difference. \nOur goal is to encourage our community to contribute through donations that will directly support important causes and help strengthen the bonds within our climbing family. As a thank-you and to add a fun twist\, every person who makes a donation will automatically be entered into a raffle for the chance to become the rappeller in an upcoming special event! \nWhether you’re a long-time supporter or new to the Boulderz Community\, this is a unique way to get involved\, give back\, and potentially take part in something unforgettable. Together\, let’s climb higher—for a cause. \nDONATE NOW
URL:https://boulderzclimbing.com/event/boulderz-community-initiative-the-drop-zone-easter-seals-2/
LOCATION:Ontario
CATEGORIES:Announcement,Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://boulderzclimbing.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/EASTER_SEALS_DROP_ZONE_ANguyenInsta1080x1080px.png
END:VEVENT
